OL,3,GNEWSAFirst ministers of Wales, Scotland
OL,4,Aand Northern Ireland to meet in Cardiff
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first ministers of Wales, Scotland
OL,7,Fand Northern Ireland will meet in
OL,8,FCardiff on Monday to discuss ways of
OL,9,F"working more closely", including on
OL,10,Fconstitutional issues.
OL,12,FIt will be the first face-to-face
OL,13,Fmeeting among the three nationalist
OL,14,Fleaders since Plaid Cymru's Rhun ap
OL,15,FIorwerth took office in May.
OL,17,FAp Iorwerth will host the SNP's leader
OL,18,FJohn Swinney and Sinn Fein's Michelle
OL,19,FO'Neill on Monday morning. Sinn Fein
OL,20,Fpresident Mary Lou McDonald will also
OL,21,Fattend.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
